{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/839423-the-house-of-thorns","id":839423,"title":"The House of Thorns","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-29T14:16:10-08:00","id":839423,"title":"The House of Thorns","content":"Hi guys. I'm trying to create a new Mystery Cult Initiation, and I would like your help to come with a few suggestions(nerfs/buffs) here.<br /> <br /> In one of my settings, there is a Haunted House in a spooky place.<br /> <br /> Some splats can call the house what they want(Gentry, Dragon Nest, Malus Loci, etc), but they cannot be really sure.<br /> The house is an entity that have the Miracle Dread Power(CofD pg 146).<br /> <br /> The house is full of ghosts, old and strange artifacts, the insides of the house are a real maze, some doors lead you to places that makes no sense, etc.<br /> The house exists in the Hedge and in the Physical World at the same time, and that has draw attetion of a few changelings.<br /> <br /> The house is not a Gentry, she does not spend her time luring people or changing them, or putting them to some kind of Durance(I really don't want to use the house as a Gentry).<br /> <br /> The house has been a meeting center for some strange cultists, some of them claim(among themselfs) to have achieved great powers after sealing a bargain with a strange creature.<br /> If you join the cult, you'll study strange and old magics, most of them seems to do nothing at all, but for those who truly believe and study hard, they'll summon Lily, a strange creature who will try to strike a bargain with them:<br /> &quot;Pay me a pinch of your blood every month, and then you can walk free inside my walls, deny my wish and your body will fall.&quot;<br /> Lily doesn't offer choice, pay the price or die. She remembers this creature:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://40.media.tumblr.com/9044a4ebe79a4cf076f116fd36d02a9d/tumblr_mhbppdNmfj1rdy3s5o1_540.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"http://40.media.tumblr.com/9044a4ebe79a4cf076f116fd36d02a9d/tumblr_mhbppdNmfj1rdy3s5o1_540.jpg\" data-thumb-url=\"http://40.media.tumblr.com/9044a4ebe79a4cf076f116fd36d02a9d/tumblr_mhbppdNmfj1rdy3s5o1_540.jpg\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> Lily, is the personification of the house, not only the house, but the entire place where the house was built. She is some sort of old Goddess of Wishes.<br /> <br /> Ok, now with the system:<br /> <br /> <b>Merit: Mystery Cult Initiation (The House of Thorns)</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> \u2022: One specialization in Occult, you can choose from:<br /> Artifacts, The Hedge, Ghosts, Sacred Geometry, Oaths.<br /> <br /> \u2022\u2022: Receive the Trained Observer at one dot.<br /> <br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022: A dot of Occult. This dot can go over the normal limits for a Skill.<br /> <br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022: The Clairvoyance merit, but you don't need to meditate, scry, spend willpower, you just need to focus on the House.<br /> Drawback: You can only use this merit inside the house or other close areas(like the garden).<br /> <br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022: Receive the Faerie Favor merit.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> So, what did you guys think about this? This house will be my &quot;villain academy&quot;. Most of the antagonists will come from the cult, but if some player join the cult, I will allow him access to the merit.<br /> <br /> Can you guys help me with the benefits? I think that the Nv 1 and 3 are fine, But I'm not sure about the rest.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Homebrews:</span></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1492909-horodrigo-homebrews-2ed\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Vampire Homebrews</b></span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>Mage Legacies:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1074696-2ed-legacy-experiment-infernal-ones\" target=\"_blank\">Infernal Ones</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1070254-2e-legacies-conversions-and-homebrew?p=1078103#post1078103\" target=\"_blank\">Daoine</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1536102-homebrew-legacy-the-changed\" target=\"_blank\">Changed</a>","edited":{"userid":7210,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7210-horodrigo","user":"Horodrigo","date":". 08-05-2024, 06:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7210-horodrigo","name":"Horodrigo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7210_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T15:23:11-08:00","id":839472,"title":"","content":"changeling can't take the lucid dreamer merit, nor would they have a use for it.<br /> <br /> Instead give Changelings a Goblin vow related somehow to the house or its grounds or Lily. None Changelings who can't get lucid dreamer instead get resources dots as one finds treasures in the house that they're allowed to take.<br /> <br /> I'd simplify the \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 merit benifit into just the Fae Favour merit, adding a template is perhaps beyond the perview of the MCI merit.<br /> <br /> I'd replace the clavoyence merit with the Hedge Beast Companion Merit, the house grants you a familiar of sorts, but in order to keep an eye on you, but it keeps you informed about what's going in the house via the distant mirror contract, Mawahahaha.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T16:03:09-08:00","id":839495,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/839423-the-house-of-thorns?p=839472#post839472\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd simplify the \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 merit benifit into just the Fae Favour merit, adding a template is perhaps beyond the perview of the MCI merit.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's a good suggestion, but I'm not sure how another supernatural being would use Faerie Favor. I'm actually a little hesitant in permiting other supernaturals with kiths, but the idea sounds cool, it's like their nature inside the house is twisted and they get some bonus for this. Changelings develop their bodies like they where in arcadia, that's why I'd like to give them Dual Kith. Vampires turns into a better predator, werewolfs transform into a thing even more bestial(like Gargantual Kith), etc. But I don't know of other merits that can help with this.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/839423-the-house-of-thorns?p=839472#post839472\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd replace the clavoyence merit with the Hedge Beast Companion Merit, the house grants you a familiar of sorts, but in order to keep an eye on you, but it keeps you informed about what's going in the house via the distant mirror contract, Mawahahaha.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bLoved the suggestion. The greater cultists will have some crazy familiars.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Homebrews:</span></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1492909-horodrigo-homebrews-2ed\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Vampire Homebrews</b></span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>Mage Legacies:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1074696-2ed-legacy-experiment-infernal-ones\" target=\"_blank\">Infernal Ones</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1070254-2e-legacies-conversions-and-homebrew?p=1078103#post1078103\" target=\"_bla